Lotline World Model engine

Derived from the Meterless World Model reference implementation
(https://github.com/Meterless/Meterless, engines/world-model/reference, Apache License 2.0),
at the upstream commit recorded in UPSTREAM_COMMIT.

Changes made for Lotline (October 2026):
- store.ts: durable append-only JSON Lines event log with crash-tolerant replay, replacing
  the rewrite-whole-file JSON persistence.
- index.ts / store.ts: fact conflict resolution is recorded in the assertFact event, so a
  replayed world equals the live one.
- claims.ts (new): a truth-maintenance layer. Agent claims record the exact evidence rows
  (with content hashes) and upstream claims they depend on; staleness is derived on read.
- conformance/runner.ts is the unmodified upstream conformance suite.
